WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Firstly, they would be able to power their grids more sustainably and rely less on natural gas and other fossil fuels.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:13.080
Secondly, they would receive other countries surplus energy at a reduced cost which would

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.360
enable greater national investment in sustainability.
